      "side": 1,
      "message": "You need to add a trailing comma:\n\n```\nwhole_static_libs: select(soong_config_variable(\"recovery\", \"target_recovery_ui_lib\"), {\n  any @ libs: libs,\n  default: [\"librecovery_ui_default\"], // \u003c--- Add this comma\n}),\n```\n\nI\u0027ve updated aosp/3367325 to also be less strict about this comma, but bpfmt will still want you to add it.",
